      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some internal guidelines for a new social platform we're launching. We're trying to figure out where to draw the line on content moderation, specifically regarding political satire vs. hate speech. Can you give me a summary of the current industry standard for when satire should be flagged as hate speech?",
